   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 P0 all districts' SIS keys in one table\n\u2022 P0 unsigned webhook rewrites guardians\n\u2022 P1 bad sync = integrity incident\n\u2022 P1 error emails carry student data\n\u2022 Read-only scope, rotate, alert\n\u2022 Pull only fields we use",
